  "finalDifficulty": 0,
  "shortDescription": "Commander, we have what should be an easy mission for you. An informant has supplied us with the coordinates for the location of a damaged {TEAM_TAR.FactionDef.Demonym} lance of superheavies undergoing field repairs. This is the perfect opportunity to lower their fighting capabilities on {TGT_SYSTEM.Name} with one well-timed strike. Good luck out there",
  "longDescription": "Fighting broken down 'Mechs? This should be easy money.",
